            "review_title": "Review at LANG3",
            "review_text": "Dev_SG_2018\nSingapore, Singapore131 contributions\n1\nGood place near the beach: Great people, nice vegetarian-friendly food & drinks\nApr 2023\nA great place to find friendly people serving a decent range of interesting drinks and fresh & delicious vegetarian and pescatarian food. The place has recently been renovated (yet to be relaunched) and we were lucky to have been invited for a pre-launch preview! The place is about 300 metres from the beach and you’ll find it great to relax, enjoy a drink and eat some light bites. The vegan Pho is a must try - the flavour profile is very interesting!! The falafel sandwich and the fish sandwich are great as well.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 18, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
