            "review_title": "Review at LANG3",
            "review_text": "An P\nDa Nang, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nLove this place!\nMay 2022 • Couples\nThis is our second time here and this place is full of surprises. The first time we were here we got free drink because it was the owner’s birthday and they treated us like friends. Today, we were here not knowing it was Mother’s Day. They brought my wife a nice rose and a tiramisu cake for the occasion. And to top it all, they have sick burger. I haven’t had a real burger for a while until today. I can’t wait to try all their menu. My wife loved their tenderloin steak with pepper corn sauce. A must try!\nRead more\nWritten May 8, 2022",
